---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms — Rakhi Battle 2026" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 24 August 2026.</p>
    <h2>Entertainment only</h2>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a humorous entertainment product. Scores and verdicts are generated from participant answers; they are not factual assessments of family relationships.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Use nicknames and lawful, non-harmful content. Do not harass people, automate votes, probe private links, attack the service, or use it for wagering or cash competitions.</p>
    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>Paid upgrades are one-time digital purchases linked to one battle and shared by both participants through that result link. Savage Mode is ₹49. Full Reveal is ₹99, or ₹50 when upgrading a battle that already has Savage Mode. Taxes, if applicable, are shown at checkout. See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>, <a href="/delivery">Delivery</a> and <a href="/refund">Refunds</a>.</p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>This is a time-limited festival experiment and may change or close. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, but we will not fabricate player counts, votes, leaderboards or testimonials.</p>
    <h2>Hall of Fame</h2>
    <p>Leaderboard participation is optional and requires consent from both players. Rankings use completed quiz scores; identical nicknames are distinguished by a unique battle code. We may remove abusive, misleading or inappropriate nicknames.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
